# D-105 native (steps/d105-native.md §4; the author's Q39: "сначала в интерпретаторе и потом нативно"): an admitted
# formal passed on to a formal of a third type: `rdM (Model: m)` hands m to `rdP (Part: p)`, Part = {a}.
# The value's type is Other; the site finds its record (o, Model), compares its table by content with
# the pair table Other -> Model, and records (o, Part) with the pair table Other -> Part: p\a = 10.
# Success is 7.
Model:
    size_t: a 1U
    size_t: b 2U
end: Model
Other:
    size_t: b 20U
    size_t: a 10U
end: Other
Part:
    size_t: a 0U
end: Part
fn: rdP (Part: p) size_t
return: p\a
fn: rdM (Model: m) size_t
return: rdP(m)
fn: go () size_t
    o: merge: Other
    return: rdM(o)
size_t: got 0U
got: go()
int: ok 3
if: got = 10U
    ok: 7
if: got = 20U
    ok: 5
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
